      "created_at": "2020-11-26T14:37:26Z",
      "updated_at": "2020-11-26T15:02:15Z",
      "body": "Is it possible to reliably avoid the setting of \"_pk_id\" and \"_pk_sess\"-Cookies in cookie-less mode? \r\n\r\nThe use of \"MATOMO_SESSID\" for security reasons and \"mtm_consent/mtm_consent_removed\"-cookies to save the opt-in/-out state of user's consent can be viewed as essential (which means that no cookie banner is needed), if there is no way to avoid them technically. I've changed our request above. Thank you for your quick feedback!",
      "author_association": "NONE",
      "pin": null,
      "reactions": {
