      "body": "@LfD-Nds  Just FYI, we have released Matomo 4.0.0 shortly, which also brings some improvements towards cookieless tracking. \r\nI've just checked that and if `disableCookies` is called for the tracker, there should not be any `_pk_id` or `_pk_sess` cookie.\r\nThe `MATOMO_SESSID` cookie is still set by the opt-out for the reasons @Findus23 mentioned.",
